      "nets": ["NET0161", "NET0103"],
      "observed": "FCC2 VCAP pins 48 and 73 are connected to UART3_FCC2 connector pins 3 and 4 on nets NET0161 and NET0103, with no decoupling capacitors.",
      "expected": "VCAP pins should be decoupled to GND with 2.2uF capacitors; UART3_FCC2 should connect to UART TX/RX pins.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"100\") (name \"NET0161\") (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"48\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\") (pintype \"power_out\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC2\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"Pin_3\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"65\") (name \"NET0103\") (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\") (pintype \"power_out\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC2\") (pin \"4\") (pinfunction \"Pin_4\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The STM32H753 core regulator lacks required decoupling, likely preventing the MCU from running; the UART3 port is non-functional.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["FCC2", "NAVC2"],
      "pins": ["FCC2.11", "FCC2.27", "FCC2.50", "FCC2.75", "FCC2.100", "NAVC2.19", "NAVC2.32", "NAVC2.48", "NAVC2.64"],
      "nets": [
        "unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad11)",
        "unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad27)",
        "unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad50)",
        "unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad75)",
        "unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad100)",
        "unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad19)",
        "unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad32)",
        "unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad48)",
        "unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad64)"
      ],
      "observed": "All VDD power pins of FCC2 and NAVC2 are on unconnected nets.",
      "expected": "VDD pins should be connected to the 3.3V rail (+3V3).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"216\") (name \"unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad11)\") (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"VDD\") (pintype \"power_in\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"276\") (name \"unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad19)\") (node (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"19\") (pinfunction \"VDD\") (pintype \"power_in\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Both MCUs are unpowered and will not operate.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["REG3"],
      "pins": ["REG3.1", "REG3.2"],
      "nets": ["+3.3V", "+3V3"],
      "observed": "The LD39200 LDO output (REG3 pins 1 and 2) is on net +3.3V, while the +3V3 net has no regulator source and is used for MCU VBAT, pull-ups, and connectors.",
      "expected": "The LDO output should be on the same net as the MCU and pull-up supply (3V3), i.e., +3.3V and +3V3 should be a single net.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+3.3V\") (node (ref \"REG3\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"OUT\") (pintype \"unspecified\")) (node (ref \"REG3\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"ADJ/SENSE\") (pintype \"unspecified\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"2\") (name \"+3V3\") (node (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"VBAT\") (pintype \"power_in\")) ...)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The 3.3V rail is split; components on +3V3 (including I2C pull-ups and connectors) are unpowered, and the LDO only powers the sensors on +3.3V.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain multiple severe anomalies: FCC2 VCAP pins are miswired to a UART connector, all MCU VDD pins are unconnected, and the 3.3V rail is split into two separate nets. These issues would prevent the board from powering up or functioning as intended."
}

